{"title": "Soul-Sworn Contract", "pageid": 36529, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Soul-Sworn_Contract", "categories": ["Misc items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Soul-Sworn_Contract_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Soul-Sworn_Contract_Faded.png/300px-Soul-Sworn_Contract_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Soul-Sworn_Contract_Faded.png/450px-Soul-Sworn_Contract_Faded.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fc/Soul-Sworn_Contract_Faded.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Soul-Sworn_Contract_Faded.png/300px-Soul-Sworn_Contract_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Soul-Sworn_Contract_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The Soul-Sworn Contract is a document created when the player character accepts <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/38px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/50px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Raphael's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael's</a> deal. \n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>In return for signing the contract, Raphael gives the party the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orphic_Hammer\" title=\"Orphic Hammer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orphic_Hammer\" title=\"Orphic Hammer\">Orphic Hammer</a> required to free <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/25px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/38px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/50px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orpheus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/25px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\">Orpheus</a>. In exchange, the party must deliver the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crown_of_Karsus\" title=\"Crown of Karsus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png/17px-Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png/26px-Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png/34px-Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crown of Karsus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png/17px-Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"17\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Crown_of_Karsus\" title=\"Crown of Karsus\">Crown of Karsus</a> to Raphael after having defeated the <a href=\"/wiki/Netherbrain\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Netherbrain\">Netherbrain</a>.\n</p><p>Raphael first attempts to make this deal in <a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress\" title=\"Sharess' Caress\">Sharess' Caress</a> as part of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deal_with_the_Devil\" title=\"Deal with the Devil\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deal with the Devil\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Deal_with_the_Devil\" title=\"Deal with the Devil\">Deal with the Devil</a>. If refusing the deal, never fighting against Raphael, and then refusing to cooperate with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor\" title=\"The Emperor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/38px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/50px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Emperor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor\" title=\"The Emperor\">The Emperor</a> during <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Confront_the_Elder_Brain\" title=\"Confront the Elder Brain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Confront the Elder Brain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Confront_the_Elder_Brain\" title=\"Confront the Elder Brain\">Confront the Elder Brain</a>, Raphael appears again and forces the party to sign the contract to obtain the Orphic Hammer. Refusing the deal at this point leads to a <a href=\"/wiki/Game_Over_screens\" title=\"Game Over screens\">Game Over screen</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Escape_the_Deal\">Escape the Deal</span></h2>\n<p>Should the party want to renege on their word, they must find a way to enter <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">Raphael's abode</a> and destroy the contract. The contract is located in the Archive room of the House of Hope but is protected by an energy field which requires a password to disable. \n</p><p>This password can be found in the Boudoir of the House and can be acquired in various ways:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Passing a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;18 Perception Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;18 <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> to notice a button underneath Raphael's portrait to the left of the bed, and a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;20 Sleight of Hand Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;20 <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> to disarm the portrait and access the hidden safe behind it. The safe can be lockpicked or opened with the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Key_From_Raphael%27s_Safe\" title=\"Key From Raphael's Safe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/20px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/40px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/20px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Key_From_Raphael%27s_Safe\" title=\"Key From Raphael's Safe\">Key From Raphael's Safe</a>, which drops from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haarlep\" title=\"Haarlep\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Portrait_Haarlep.png/25px-Portrait_Haarlep.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Portrait_Haarlep.png/38px-Portrait_Haarlep.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Portrait_Haarlep.png/50px-Portrait_Haarlep.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haarlep\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Portrait_Haarlep.png/25px-Portrait_Haarlep.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Portrait_Haarlep.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haarlep\" title=\"Haarlep\">Haarlep</a>. The safe contains the password and five <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Coin\" title=\"Soul Coin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Soul_Coin_Unfaded_Icon.webp/20px-Soul_Coin_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Soul_Coin_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Coin_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Soul_Coin_Unfaded_Icon.webp/40px-Soul_Coin_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Soul_Coin_Unfaded_Icon.webp/20px-Soul_Coin_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Soul_Coin_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Coin\" title=\"Soul Coin\">Soul Coins</a>.</li>\n<li>Having an intimate moment with Haarlep without losing their body and mind by succeeding a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;18 Wisdom Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;18 <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;18 Performance Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;18 <a href=\"/wiki/Performance\" title=\"Performance\">Performance</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>. This results in the incubus handling the key for the safe.</li></ul>\n<p><b>WARNING</b>: Attempting to fight Raphael before destroying the Soul-Sworn Contract results in his claiming the player character's soul, leading to a <a href=\"/wiki/Game_Over_screens\" title=\"Game Over screens\">Game Over screen</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_Quests\">Related Quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deal_with_the_Devil\" title=\"Deal with the Devil\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deal with the Devil\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Deal_with_the_Devil\" title=\"Deal with the Devil\">Deal with the Devil</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Escape_the_Deal\" title=\"Escape the Deal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Escape the Deal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Escape_the_Deal\" title=\"Escape the Deal\">Escape the Deal</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fulfill_the_Deal\" title=\"Fulfill the Deal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fulfill the Deal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fulfill_the_Deal\" title=\"Fulfill the Deal\">Fulfill the Deal</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<ul><li>The contract cannot be picked up. While the player character is given the option of doing so, it always triggers the dialogue option to destroy it instead.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714194838\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time